Third-party components
======================

Site design and code
--------------------
Adapted from the source of Erich Grunewald's blog.

  Source:     https://github.com/erwald/blog
  Author:     Erich Grunewald
  Licence:    MIT (stated in that repository's README)
  Used in:    .eleventy.js, _includes/, index.njk, start_here.njk, feed.njk,
              css/index.css, css/fonts.css, dither.sh

  What changed: ported from Eleventy 0.11 to Eleventy 3 (updated plugin and
  markdown-it APIs); the palette was inverted to a dark theme with a muted
  cyan accent; the Substack, Plausible and Netlify integrations were removed
  in favour of Cloudflare, an RSS-only subscribe box and no analytics; the
  newsletter page was replaced by the GPG page; the featured-post list
  moved from a hard-coded array into _data/featured.json; reading time is
  computed by a local filter rather than a plugin.

  None of Erich Grunewald's writing or images are included in this repository.
  His prose and images are CC BY-SA 4.0 and remain his.

